<title>JAPAN: Dec JGB futures set record high of 126.53 in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Dec JGB futures set record high of 126.53 in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key December Japanese government bond (JGB) futures contract was sharply up in early morning Tokyo trade on Thursday, hitting a new record high for any benchmark futures contract of 126.53.</p>
<p>It closed at 126.04 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
